                "title": "Modern Top Mount Stainless Steel Barn Door Kit, Emtek B1201SS",
                "description": "This is a Top Mount Modern Stainless Steel Rectangular Barn Door Kit. It is available with either a spoked or solid wheel design in 2 finishes. The track comes in 6 different lengths to accommodate a wide variety of openings for a single or double door application.  It comes packaged with all necessary installation hardware and features an anti-jump design that will keep the sliding door from easily falling off the track.",
